# @domain: policies
# #4964 — one violation of prod-private-by-default-graduation: a personal-data graph with no visibility on any record.
@prefix jb: <https://jeffbridwell.com/ontology#> .
<urn:gathering:zz-novis> { <urn:zz:1> a jb:Note . }
<urn:gathering:zz-private> { <urn:zz:2> a jb:Note ; jb:hasVisibility jb:Private . }
<urn:gathering:icd/zz> { <urn:zz:3> a jb:Provider . }
